%h2 Make a Refund

%h3 Find the Charge

%p Enter the username or email of the user to get the list of charges. Then click 'Refund' on the charge you want to refund. You can make partial refunds too.

= form_tag find_charges_admin_refunds_path, class: 'form-inline', method: 'get' do
  = text_field_tag "identifier", nil, class: "input-large", placeholder: "email or username", autocomplete: "off"
  = submit_tag "Find"

- if @charges
  %h3
    Charges for
    = @user.username

  %table.table
    %thead
      %tr
        %th Created
        %th ID
        %th Amount
        %th Refunded
        %th
    %tbody
      - @charges.each do |charge|
        %tr
          %td
            = Time.at(charge.created).to_s(:long)
          %td
            = charge.id
          %td
            = as_currency charge.amount
          %td
            = charge.refunded
          %td
            - unless charge.refunded
              = link_to 'Refund', new_admin_refund_url(user_id: @user.id, stripe_charge_id: charge.id, amount: charge.amount), class: 'btn btn-primary'
